@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>CPE Review Hub stores account details in the configured MySQL database. Passwords are hashed with ASP.NET Core Identity. Session cookies are used to keep you signed in.</p>
<p>Students can view and edit their own profile. Authorized administrators can view student names, email addresses, and account status.</p>
<p>This is a development version. Before collecting real student data, the institution must publish its retention policy, privacy contact, and account deletion process.</p>
